# Admin skill stays in sync

You are on Admin paths. Product facts an agent cannot infer live in
`.claude/skills/admin-mytrion/SKILL.md` (mirrored to `.cursor/skills/` and `.agents/skills/`).

If this change touches **tabs, gates (`allDepartmentAccess` vs role), caps, parked flags, or
which store a write hits**, update that skill in the **same PR** (all three mirrors). Read
the skill before editing Admin UI or APIs.

`department: 'admin'` is not a `department_access` tag. Escalation routing, carrier
invitations, and logs export are live and mounted. Kitchen (`/kitchen`) and header View-as
are not Admin tabs. Do not restyle `MytrionShell` sidebar/header.
